# TelPy Standard Library & Localization

## Built-in Functions

| Python | TelPy | Comparison / Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `print()` | `chupinchu()` | *Meaning*: Show. Action-oriented. |
| `input()` | `adugu()` | *Meaning*: Ask. Very intuitive. |
| `len()` | `podavu()` | *Meaning*: Length. |
| `range()` | `shreni()` | *Meaning*: Series/Range. |
| `open()` | `theruvu()` | *Meaning*: Open. |
| `type()` | `rakam()` | *Meaning*: Type/Kind. |
| `int()` | `anke()` | *Meaning*: Number/Digit. |
| `float()` | `dashaamsam()` | *Meaning*: Decimal. |
| `str()` | `padam()` | *Meaning*: Word. |
| `list()` | `jaabitha()` | *Meaning*: List. |
| `dict()` | `nighantuvu()` | *Meaning*: Dictionary. |
| `set()` | `samithi()` | *Meaning*: Set (Math term). |
| `help()` | `sahayam()` | *Meaning*: Help. |

## Error Messages (Error Localizations)

The goal is to provide "clear, actionable Telugu terms".

| Python Error | TelPy Error | English Translation |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `SyntaxError` | `Vyakarana Thappu` | Grammar Mistake |
| `IndentationError` | `Khali Sthalam Thappu` | Empty Space (Indentation) Mistake |
| `NameError` | `Peru Thappu` | Name Mistake (Name not found) |
| `TypeError` | `Rakam Thappu` | Type Mistake |
| `ValueError` | `Viluva Thappu` | Value Mistake |
| `IndexError` | `Soochika Thappu` | Index Mistake |
| `KeyError` | `Thaalam Thappu` | Key (Lock) Mistake (User suggested 'goliyadha', but 'Thaalam' is standard for Key) |
| `ZeroDivisionError` | `Sunna Tho Bhagahaaram` | Division by Zero |
| `ImportError` | `Thecchukovadam Thappu` | Import Mistake |
